{"id":"f249216f43ced95c","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-adem-relations.md","title":"Adem Relations","display":"thm-adem-relations — Adem Relations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-adem-relations","aliases":["58-thm-adem-relations"],"display":"thm-adem-relations — Adem Relations","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-adem-relations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-adem-relations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-adem-relations — Adem Relations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f3e7eea5614d92a\" href=\"?note=3f3e7eea5614d92a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md\">../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0adc4e3c996ff726\" href=\"?note=0adc4e3c996ff726\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md\">../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\omega\">\\(a,b\\in\\omega\\)</span> (operation indices)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sq^n\">\\(Sq^n\\)</span> (mod-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> Steenrod squares)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> (odd prime) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^n\">\\(P^n\\)</span> (mod-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> reduced powers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\)</span> (prime predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}adem\\text{-}mod\\text{-}2}\\vdash a,b\\in\\omega\\land0&lt;a&lt;2b\\to Sq^aSq^b=_{\\mathcal A_2}\\sum_{j=0}^{\\lfloor a/2\\rfloor}\\binom{b-j-1}{a-2j}Sq^{a+b-j}Sq^j\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}adem\\text{-}mod\\text{-}2}\\vdash a,b\\in\\omega\\land0&lt;a&lt;2b\\to Sq^aSq^b=_{\\mathcal A_2}\\sum_{j=0}^{\\lfloor a/2\\rfloor}\\binom{b-j-1}{a-2j}Sq^{a+b-j}Sq^j\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}adem\\text{-}odd\\text{-}primary}\\vdash \\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land2&lt;p\\land a,b\\in\\omega\\land0&lt;a&lt;pb\\to P^aP^b=_{\\mathcal A_p}\\sum_{j=0}^{\\lfloor a/p\\rfloor}(-1)^{a+j}\\binom{(p-1)(b-j)-1}{a-pj}P^{a+b-j}P^j\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}adem\\text{-}odd\\text{-}primary}\\vdash \\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land2&lt;p\\land a,b\\in\\omega\\land0&lt;a&lt;pb\\to P^aP^b=_{\\mathcal A_p}\\sum_{j=0}^{\\lfloor a/p\\rfloor}(-1)^{a+j}\\binom{(p-1)(b-j)-1}{a-pj}P^{a+b-j}P^j\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Binomial coefficients are reduced modulo the relevant prime.</li>\n<li>These Adem relations, together with the generators, present the indicated reduced-power part of the Steenrod algebra; the additional odd-primary relations involving the Bockstein are not asserted here.</li>\n<li>Basis: admissible monomials <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sq^{i_1} \\cdots Sq^{i_k}\">\\(Sq^{i_1} \\cdots Sq^{i_k}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_j \\geq 2i_{j+1}\">\\(i_j \\geq 2i_{j+1}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Cartan formula: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sq^n(xy) = \\sum Sq^i(x) Sq^{n-i}(y)\">\\(Sq^n(xy) = \\sum Sq^i(x) Sq^{n-i}(y)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f3e7eea5614d92a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-steenrod-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"0adc4e3c996ff726","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-natural-number.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"Sq^n","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"P^n","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}adem\\text{-}mod\\text{-}2}\\vdash a,b\\in\\omega\\land0<a<2b\\to Sq^aSq^b=_{\\mathcal A_2}\\sum_{j=0}^{\\lfloor a/2\\rfloor}\\binom{b-j-1}{a-2j}Sq^{a+b-j}Sq^j","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}adem\\text{-}odd\\text{-}primary}\\vdash \\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land2<p\\land a,b\\in\\omega\\land0<a<pb\\to P^aP^b=_{\\mathcal A_p}\\sum_{j=0}^{\\lfloor a/p\\rfloor}(-1)^{a+j}\\binom{(p-1)(b-j)-1}{a-pj}P^{a+b-j}P^j","display":true},{"tex":"Sq^{i_1} \\cdots Sq^{i_k}","display":false},{"tex":"i_j \\geq 2i_{j+1}","display":false},{"tex":"Sq^n(xy) = \\sum Sq^i(x) Sq^{n-i}(y)","display":false}],"bytes":1421,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4021","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-adem-relations.md|58-thm-adem-relations]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["3f3e7eea5614d92a","3322615e4eea05e9","0adc4e3c996ff726"]}